sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>8081/TCP
    participant ExtProc as Payload Processor<br/>9004/TCP gRPC<br/>Self-signed TLS (default)
    participant ModelServer as Model Server (vLLM)<br/>8000/TCP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Scraper

    Note over Client,ModelServer: Inference Request Flow

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP
    Envoy->>ExtProc: gRPC ExtProc RequestHeaders callout<br/>Optional self-signed TLS
    Note right of ExtProc: Pre-processors execute:<br/>1. body-field-to-header<br/>2. base-model-extractor<br/>3. model-group-filter
    ExtProc-->>Envoy: Modified headers
    Envoy->>ExtProc: gRPC ExtProc RequestBody callout
    Note right of ExtProc: Profile picker executes:<br/>scoring, session affinity,<br/>cost guard, model selection
    ExtProc-->>Envoy: Modified request body + routing
    Envoy->>ModelServer: Forward inference request<br/>HTTP/8000
    ModelServer-->>Envoy: Inference response
    Envoy->>ExtProc: gRPC ExtProc ResponseHeaders callout
    Note right of ExtProc: Post-processors execute:<br/>response header injection,<br/>metadata extraction
    ExtProc-->>Envoy: Modified response headers
    Envoy->>ExtProc: gRPC ExtProc ResponseBody callout<br/>(EndOfStream)
    ExtProc-->>Envoy: Modified response body
    Envoy-->>Client: Final inference response

    Note over K8sAPI,ExtProc: ConfigMap Reconciliation Flow

    K8sAPI->>ExtProc: ConfigMap watch notification<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount auth
    Note right of ExtProc: ConfigMapReconciler updates<br/>in-memory model resolution table<br/>(no restart required)

    Note over Prometheus,ExtProc: Observability Flow

    Prometheus->>ExtProc: GET /metrics<br/>HTTP/9090
    Note right of ExtProc: Kubernetes TokenReview auth<br/>(optional, default enabled)
    ExtProc-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
